{
    "title": "Live Weather Radar Launcher",
    "description": "Live Weather Radar Launcher is an easy-to-use weather app that allows you to track changing weather conditions with live radar maps and helps you prepare for unexpected weather. Simply swipe right from your home screen to access a live weather radar, forecast maps, weekly weather reports, air quality index, and more. \r\n\r\nKey features\r\n\u2713 One-swipe access\r\n\u2713 Live weather radar\r\n\u2713 Forecast map\r\n\u2713 Radar map layers\r\n\u2713 Map modes\r\n\u2713 Hourly & weekly forecast\r\n\u2713 Temperature forecast & AQI\r\n\u2713 Multiple access points to search on Yahoo\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude80 One-swipe access: Get quick access to Live Weather Radar Launcher's features with one swipe from your home screen. No more digging through your app list; weather radar is just a swipe away.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf27\ufe0f Live weather radar: Stay on top of the weather in real time. Check areas of precipitation, so you're never caught off guard by sudden showers or unexpected weather. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f Forecast map: View past weather patterns and expected conditions for up to 6 hours. Use the forecast playback feature to see both historical and future forecasts via an advanced radar layer.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udce1 Radar map layers: Get detailed weather insights with our radar map layers. Track rain or snow, temperature patterns, cloud cover, wind forecasts, and sea level pressure for a comprehensive view of atmospheric conditions.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Map modes: Customize your weather experience with our map modes. Easily switch between light, dark, and satellite views to suit your viewing preferences.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc6 Hourly & weekly forecast: Live Weather Radar Launcher provides an hourly weather outlook for up to 96 hours, so you're always informed. Plan your week with our accurate 7-day forecasts.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf21\ufe0f Temperature forecast & AQI: Dress right for the weather with up-to-the-minute temperature information. Monitor the air quality in your area and make informed decisions about outdoor activities.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Multi-touchpoint search with search results powered by Yahoo: Finding what you need has never been easier. Enjoy an enhanced search experience with access to Yahoo web search via multiple access points.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfe0 Home screen shortcut: Use the Live Weather Radar Launcher shortcut on your home screen for instant access to weather radar maps and stay ahead of unpredictable weather conditions.\r\n\r\nPlease write to us should you have any queries or comments about the app, including recommendations for new features. Also, please note that you can uninstall it at any time.\r\n\r\nYou give your consent to install Live Weather Radar Launcher from the Google Play\u2122 Store by clicking the button above. You also agree to this app's Terms and Conditions & Privacy Policy.\r\n\r\nGoogle Play is a trademark of Google LLC. Use of it here does not imply any affiliation with or endorsement by Google LLC.\r\n\r\nTerms of Service: https://liveweatherradar.com/terms-of-service \r\nPrivacy Policy: https://liveweatherradar.com/privacy-policy",
